  "solution": {
    "text": "The given equation can be written as <math><msup><mrow><mn>5</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><msup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><msup><mrow><mn>5</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><msup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><msup><mrow><mn>5</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup><mo>…</mo><msup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><msup><mrow><mn>5</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><msup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><msup><mrow><mn>5</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>28</mn></mrow></msup></math><br /><math><msup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><msup><mrow><mn>5</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>+</mo><mo>…</mo><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><msup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><msup><mrow><mn>5</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>28</mn></mrow></msup></math><br /><math><mo>⇒</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>28</mn></math><br /><math><mo>⇒</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>7</mn></math>",
